Meta.documentation:localstorage
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:localstorage:<path> - the browser's localStorage as a file
Meta.documentation:repository, alongside file: and http:. Paths are relative to
Meta.documentation:the repository root; every stored file keeps its mime type.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:file-parity: <path>?read reads, ?write / ?append are sinks;
Meta.documentation:String.read answers directory listings (text/directory-json)
Meta.documentation:and file content (cast through the Content-Type tree, like
Meta.documentation:file:); Data.write takes { path, content, mime? }. Intended
Meta.documentation:as the editor/console file target when the site does not run on
Meta.documentation:localhost (where file: is unreachable by design).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:In the browser the real localStorage persists per origin; on
Meta.documentation:the server an in-memory shim keeps flows runnable (persistence
Meta.documentation:is browser-only by design).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@kind scheme
Meta.documentation:@status experimental
[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20localstorage%3A%20-%20the%20browser's%20localStorage%20as%20a%20file%20repository.%0A%2F%2F%20Layout%3A%20one%20localStorage%20key%20per%20file%2C%20%22localstorage%3A%22%20%2B%20path%3B%20the%20value%20is%0A%2F%2F%20a%20JSON%20envelope%20%7B%20mime%2C%20enc%2C%20data%2C%20time%20%7D%20(enc%20%22utf8%22%20or%20%22base64%22)%20so%20text%0A%2F%2F%20stays%20human-inspectable%20and%20binary%20survives.%20Directories%20do%20not%20exist%20as%0A%2F%2F%20keys%20-%20they%20are%20the%20path%20prefixes%20of%20stored%20files%2C%20enumerated%20on%20demand.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Server-side%20there%20is%20no%20localStorage%3A%20an%20in-memory%20shim%20with%20the%20same%20API%0A%2F%2F%20keeps%20flows%20runnable%20(a%20test%2Fdeploy%20convenience%20-%20persistence%20is%20a%20browser%0A%2F%2F%20property%2C%20the%20deployed%20editor%2Fconsole%20is%20the%20intended%20user).%0A%0Aconst%20LS_PREFIX%20%3D%20%22localstorage%3A%22%3B%0A%0Avar%20__mem%20%3D%20null%3B%0Afunction%20backend()%0A%7B%0A%09if%20(typeof%20localStorage%20!%3D%3D%20%22undefined%22)%20return%20localStorage%3B%0A%09if%20(!__mem)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09var%20store%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09%09__mem%20%3D%20%7B%0A%09%09%09store%3A%20store%2C%0A%09%09%09getItem%3A%20function(k)%20%7B%20return%20Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(store%2C%20k)%20%3F%20store%5Bk%5D%20%3A%20null%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09setItem%3A%20function(k%2C%20v)%20%7B%20store%5Bk%5D%20%3D%20String(v)%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09removeItem%3A%20function(k)%20%7B%20delete%20store%5Bk%5D%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09key%3A%20function(i)%20%7B%20var%20ks%20%3D%20Object.keys(store)%3B%20return%20i%20%3C%20ks.length%20%3F%20ks%5Bi%5D%20%3A%20null%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09get%20length()%20%7B%20return%20Object.keys(store).length%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09return%20__mem%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20accepts%20%22localstorage%3Aa%2Fb%22%2C%20%22localstorage%3A%2Fa%2Fb%22%2C%20%22%2Fa%2Fb%22%2C%20%22a%2Fb%22%20-%20strips%20the%0A%2F%2F%20scheme%2C%20leading%20slashes%20and%20the%20query%20string%0Afunction%20normalizePath(p)%0A%7B%0A%09p%20%3D%20String(p%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09const%20q%20%3D%20p.indexOf(%22%3F%22)%3B%0A%09if%20(q%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%20p%20%3D%20p.slice(0%2C%20q)%3B%0A%09if%20(p.indexOf(LS_PREFIX)%20%3D%3D%3D%200)%20p%20%3D%20p.slice(LS_PREFIX.length)%3B%0A%09while%20(p.indexOf(%22%2F%22)%20%3D%3D%3D%200)%20p%20%3D%20p.slice(1)%3B%0A%09return%20p%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20mimeForExtension(url)%0A%7B%0A%09const%20ext%20%3D%20(String(url).match(%2F%5C.%5Ba-z0-9%5D%2B%24%2Fi)%20%7C%7C%20%5B%22%22%5D)%5B0%5D.toLowerCase()%3B%0A%09const%20TYPES%20%3D%20%7B%0A%09%09%22.txt%22%3A%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22.md%22%3A%22text%2Fmarkdown%22%2C%20%22.dawn%22%3A%22text%2Fdawn%22%2C%20%22.html%22%3A%22text%2Fhtml%22%2C%0A%09%09%22.xml%22%3A%22text%2Fxml%22%2C%20%22.json%22%3A%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20%22.bnft%22%3A%22text%2Fbnft%22%2C%0A%09%09%22.png%22%3A%22image%2Fpng%22%2C%20%22.jpg%22%3A%22image%2Fjpeg%22%2C%20%22.jpeg%22%3A%22image%2Fjpeg%22%2C%20%22.gif%22%3A%22image%2Fgif%22%2C%0A%09%09%22.webp%22%3A%22image%2Fwebp%22%2C%20%22.svg%22%3A%22image%2Fsvg%2Bxml%22%2C%0A%09%09%22.js%22%3A%22text%2Fjavascript%22%2C%20%22.css%22%3A%22text%2Fcss%22%2C%20%22.ico%22%3A%22image%2Fx-icon%22%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09return%20TYPES%5Bext%5D%20%7C%7C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20isTextMime(mime)%0A%7B%0A%09return%20%2F%5Etext%5C%2F%2F.test(mime)%20%7C%7C%20mime%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22application%2Fjson%22%20%7C%7C%20mime%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22application%2Fdawn%22%0A%09%09%7C%7C%20mime%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22application%2Fjavascript%22%20%7C%7C%20mime%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22image%2Fsvg%2Bxml%22%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20the%20repository%20listing%20for%20one%20directory%3A%20%7B%20name%3A%20%7B%20contentType%2C%20size%2C%20time%20%7D%20%7D%0A%2F%2F%20-%20the%20same%20entry%20shape%20the%20file%3A%20reference%20server%20produces.%0Afunction%20read_dir(dirurl)%0A%7B%0A%09const%20dir%20%3D%20normalizePath(dirurl)%3B%0A%09const%20b%20%3D%20backend()%3B%0A%09const%20listing%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09for%20(let%20i%20%3D%200%3B%20i%20%3C%20b.length%3B%20i%2B%2B)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20key%20%3D%20b.key(i)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!key%20%7C%7C%20key.indexOf(LS_PREFIX)%20!%3D%3D%200)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09const%20full%20%3D%20key.substring(LS_PREFIX.length)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(dir%20!%3D%3D%20%22%22%20%26%26%20full.indexOf(dir%20%2B%20%22%2F%22)%20!%3D%3D%200)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09const%20rest%20%3D%20dir%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22%22%20%3F%20full%20%3A%20full.substring(dir.length%20%2B%201)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(rest%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22%22)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09const%20slash%20%3D%20rest.indexOf(%22%2F%22)%3B%0A%09%09const%20name%20%3D%20slash%20%3D%3D%3D%20-1%20%3F%20rest%20%3A%20rest.substring(0%2C%20slash)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22%22)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09if%20(slash%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20a%20nested%20path%3A%20the%20entry%20is%20a%20directory%20(directories%20win%20the%20name)%0A%09%09%09if%20(!listing%5Bname%5D%20%7C%7C%20listing%5Bname%5D.contentType%20!%3D%3D%20%22text%2Fdirectory-json%22)%0A%09%09%09%09listing%5Bname%5D%20%3D%20Object.assign(%7B%20contentType%3A%20%22text%2Fdirectory-json%22%2C%20size%3A%200%2C%20time%3A%200%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09continue%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09let%20env%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20env%20%3D%20JSON.parse(b.getItem(key))%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%20env%20%3D%20null%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09const%20size%20%3D%20env%20%3F%20(env.enc%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22base64%22%20%3F%20Math.floor(env.data.length%20*%203%20%2F%204)%20%3A%20env.data.length)%20%3A%200%3B%0A%09%09listing%5Bname%5D%20%3D%20%7B%20contentType%3A%20(env%20%26%26%20env.mime)%20%7C%7C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20size%3A%20size%2C%20time%3A%20(env%20%26%26%20env.time)%20%7C%7C%200%20%7D%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09return%20listing%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20read_raw(path)%0A%7B%0A%09const%20p%20